  "description": "From first gate drops to weekend race days, the Cobalt range is built to help riders progress with confidence. Proven race geometry paired with carefully chosen components creates a bike that's responsive, reliable, and ready to line up.\nThe Cobalt Mini brings the same race-ready attitude in a package tailored for the sport's smallest riders. Lightweight, properly proportioned, and designed for BMX racing from the ground up, it's the perfect platform for building skills and having fun on the track.\nUpdated colours and graphics keep the Cobalt looking fresh, while sealed front hubs and integrated headsets provide the durability needed for a full season of racing. Race-focused performance without the premium price tag—that's what the Cobalt is all about.",
